  "abstract": "Test AdamW with weight decay 1e-4 on the LayerNorm + H=96 variant (k=320,p=32, \u03b3_end=0.99). Keeps residual copy, MAE+temporal curvature, and V-orthogonality (\u03bb=1e-5).",
